  "content_id": "16136238",
  "title": "TON (The Open Network) Network Fees",
  "description": "TON (The Open Network) – Speed and Simplicity\nTON is a high-speed blockchain originally developed by Telegram’s team, now decentralized an...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ21D08XSC1CT86PF440VBH\">TON (The Open Network) – Speed and Simplicity</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">TON is a high-speed blockchain originally developed by Telegram’s team, now decentralized and focused on fast, affordable transactions.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ21D08HKKBDFBD1VXDAXQP\">How TON Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">TON fees are based on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size</b> (in bytes)</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion</b><br>Fees are paid in <b>TON tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge automatically estimates the ideal fee for your TON transaction based on network activity and transaction size.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ21D0815F93KEH9SAPX869\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced cost and speed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest option, slightly slower</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Manually set your own fee if you prefer</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ21D08ZNKWCTF77YFNAC7E\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">A TON transaction usually costs around <b>$0.001 to $0.005 USD</b> — extremely cheap.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ21D0865XVH6Q8SZ70MRF7\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">TON is designed for ultra-fast, low-cost transactions, perfect for daily use. With Edge, you don’t have to worry about overpaying—smart fee estimates keep it simple and efficient.</p>",
